<title>UK: Den Norske sets 1.0 bln mark three-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Den Norske sets 1.0 bln mark three-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager UBS (Germany).</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEN NORSKE BANK SA</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    15.SEP.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     FLAT	PAY DATE    15.SEP.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A2	  ISS PRICE  99.97     FULL FEES   15 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    99.97</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE/NO</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  NORWAY    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    7.5 BP    SELL CONC  7.5 BP    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	DISCOUNT MARGIN 3M LIBOR PLUS ONE BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
